  "notes": "Prepare the private POSIX driver runtime with umask 0077, including venv metadata, pip output and the readiness marker. Tighten copied template modes in the fresh stage without following symlinks; preserve owner executable permissions. Restore the caller's umask on success and failure; keep ownership and writable-directory checks strict. Repair previously prepared runtimes through the existing Prepare drivers action. A real Linux regression runs with SSH-style umask 0002, verifies private per...",
